  <item>
    <title>Podcastmas24：新年将至🥳邀请47位朋友用声音做一道填空题😆</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/677364e21e823e72d3177d81</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">677364e21e823e72d3177d81</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 31 Dec 2024 03:49:32 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>题目：24，（ &nbsp;&nbsp;），25，（ &nbsp;&nbsp;）。</span></p><span></span><p><span>感谢这次关注、参加「Podcastmas24」企划的每一位朋友！也欢迎收听节目的你在评论区留下你的答案～😆</span></p><span></span><p><span>（顺序不分先后）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="59">00:59</a> Jiang.zuhao：闪耀发光！✨</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="68">01:08</a> 林BC：毕业时列的待完成清单已经完成了一大半</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="116">01:56</a> kevin：希望春天依旧带着花儿盛开🌸</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="200">03:20</a> Healthy：就看见真实的经历</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="272">04:32</a> 神秘的方方：所有的遗憾都是另有安排</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="294">04:54</a> Chris：work life balance</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="317">05:17</a> LandH：成功推免到了理想的大学，一个全新的开始</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="348">05:48</a> rf：这个世界上也许没有完全正确的选择，勇敢的去面对所有可能发生的事情，因为，这也是生活的一部分。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="413">06:53</a> 王老师：朋友们快来找我玩！我会请你们吃五星级沙县小吃～</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="493">08:13</a> Ming：音乐现场🎵成为一整年的刻度</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="686">11:26</a> 小魏老师：一颗自由自在的小灵魂</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="848">14:08</a> sin：即使和父母相隔千里，他们仍是我最坚强的后盾</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="967">16:07</a> U老师：要多去表达爱，多去享受爱</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1141">19:01</a> 艾米荔：和自己的心驻守在一起，用肉身反复与这个世界碰撞</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1444">24:04</a> 十一：拔掉了身体里一直禁锢我的钉子</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1455">24:15</a> yjjnn：幸福充实的一年～</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1473">24:33</a> 根根：这是好的新的12年生命周期的开始</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1567">26:07</a> Jodie：在动荡不安的20岁，有我爱的人在我身边，就是我想要的生活</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1638">27:18</a> 乘乘：世界 / 国家 / 自己</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1707">28:27</a> 抠抠：希望可以调回福建工作</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1728">28:48</a> 旋旋：有勇气去到更远的地方</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1745">29:05</a> LUOLUO：在喜欢的运动上有了一些成果🏓</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1802">30:02</a> 森山：睁开眼睛看世界</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1835">30:35</a> 陈住气：无论怎么努力，人生总是起伏的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2294">38:14</a> 土豆小子：勇敢、坚强、在改变当中成长</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2341">39:01</a> nita：这一次换我祝福我自己</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2460">41:00</a> zyx：一个人飞往陌生的城市见最想见的人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2503">41:43</a> 一分：去了19座城市，看了16场演出</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2518">41:58</a> strange：前进！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2524">42:04</a> 派派：短暂的燃烧与长期的熄灭 / 模糊的主线与内耗的循环 / 虚无与割裂感</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2885">48:05</a> 小路：坚定理想信念！脚踏实地的走好每一步～</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2910">48:30</a> niki：自由和爆发式成长</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2923">48:43</a> Zny：享受、未知、成长</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3033">50:33</a> 欢欢：你想要的，都会有的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3079">51:19</a> 薯饼：感谢所有的经历与期待</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3090">51:30</a> susu福福：学生时代的最后一年啦🧑‍🎓</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3114">51:54</a> Jaixon：每一份努力都没有白费</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3138">52:18</a> Ruby：只要好好活着，一切都有可能</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3457">57:37</a> 小橘：发财！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3465">57:45</a> Z_BW：在离别还没有来临的时候，用尽所能去珍惜所有的时光</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3563">59:23</a> 含光光：勇敢者会得到勇敢者的嘉赏🏅</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3726">01:02:06</a> 赖赖：小猫咪🐱它们其实什么都懂</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3895">01:04:55</a> XieYuquan：我们去拍大火箭吧🚀</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3969">01:06:09</a> 大粉一号：职场教会了我一边接纳一边屏蔽</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4164">01:09:24</a> feifei：用头上的触角去和磁场一致的人握手</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4275">01:11:15</a> 小谢：以创作者的身份继续拓展更多的领域</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4400">01:13:20</a> wei：继续保持对生活的热情</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4414">01:13:34</a> 问问：找回最初梦想的一年</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4513">01:15:13</a> 感谢&amp;总结</span></p><span></span><p><span>Podcastmas24圆满结束！新年快乐🎉 2025年，我依然会在这里，用声音陪伴你，愿我们一起成长～</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fg8bLFkmsxG_8D9M4hsCuINI_FxE.jpg"></figure>]]></description>
